## Neue Datapack Struktur:

# Datapack Strucktur:
# (+) = Neu
# (>) = Bearbeiten
# (-) = Entfernen
# (*) = Alt/Vorhanden
* Test
    * data
        + minecraft
            + tags
                + function
                    + tick.json
        * test
            * function
                + start_autotest.mcfunction
                + steps
                    + start.mcfunction
                    + switch.mcfunction
                > first.mcfunction


